ENGINEERING DISCLAIMER

This software automates calls to the RSG CFS 15 calculation engine for
cold-formed steel design. It is a tool, not a licensed engineer. All results
must be reviewed and sealed by a qualified structural engineer of record before
use in construction. The authors accept no responsibility for designs produced
with this software.

"CFS", "RSG", and the CFS Automation Module are products of RSG Software, Inc.
This project is an independent integration and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by RSG Software, Inc. You must have your own licensed copy of CFS 15
with the Automation option to use this server. "SSMA", "SFIA", and profile
designations are the property of their respective owners.
